Create interface definitions in appropriate packages:

**internal/secrets/provider.go:**
```go
// SecretProvider retrieves secrets from a backend storage system.
// Implementations must be safe for concurrent use.
type SecretProvider interface {
    // Fetch retrieves a secret by reference.
    // Returns ErrSecretNotFound if secret doesn't exist.
    // Returns ErrPermissionDenied if access is denied.
    // Returns ErrTimeout if operation times out.
    Fetch(ctx context.Context, ref string) (string, error)
}
```

**internal/auth/strategy.go:**
```go
// AuthStrategy applies authentication to an HTTP request.
// Implementations must NOT modify the original request.
type AuthStrategy interface {
    // Apply injects authentication into the request.
    // The request may be cloned if modification is needed.
    Apply(ctx context.Context, req *http.Request, secret string) error
}
```

**internal/service/registry.go:**
```go
// ServiceRegistry stores and retrieves service configurations.
type ServiceRegistry interface {
    // Register adds a service to the registry.
    Register(service *Service) error

    // Lookup finds a service by hostname.
    Lookup(hostname string) (*Service, bool)

    // ListAll returns all registered services.
    ListAll() []*Service
}
```

